%N A012146 Expansion of e.g.f. arcsin(tan(sin(x))) (only odd powers).
%e A012146 E.g.f. = x + 2/3!*x^3 + 16/5!*x^5 + 440/7!*x^7 + 27904/9!*x^9 + ...
%t A012146 With[{nn=30},Take[CoefficientList[Series[ArcSin[Tan[Sin[x]]],{x,0,nn}],x] Range[0,nn-1]!,{2,-1,2}]] (* _Harvey P. Dale_, May 13 2019 *)
%o A012146 (PARI) my(x='x+O('x^50), v=Vec(serlaplace(asin(tan(sin(x)))))); vector(#v\2, i, v[2*i-1]) \\ _Michel Marcus_, Sep 26 2026
